      <marc:subfield code="a">Discovering English Year 2 is creatively designed to attract children to learn English language through a whole new, fully-interactive experience! Based on the KBSR syllabus, it is jam-packed with colourful animations, videos and delightful characters to keep the children entertained and build up essential vocabulary. This program enhances critical and creative thinking skills (CCTS), as children try to solve the replayable and interactive problems. A corresponding activity book is included to reinforce understanding of KBSR skills.</marc:subfield>
